ti-semitism and became an anti-&amp;#39;gentile&amp;#39; lobby group. Of course, the question one might ask reading the Old Testament or the Torah is whether the Jew is not characterised more by his hatred of others than by anything conventionally spiritual.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4082587910498177714/comments/default/5569015608769034048'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4082587910498177714/comments/default/5569015608769034048'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/adls-holocaust-denial.html?showComment=1269086392892#c5569015608769034048' title=''/><author><name>Louie</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/adls-holocaust-denial.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4082587910498177714' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4082587910498177714' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-232656144"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 20, 2010 at 5:59 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-355387299268113276</id><published>2008-02-10T11:24:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-02-10T11:24:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>The so called 6 million official version of the Ho...</title><content type='html'>The so called 6 million official version of the Holocaust is one of the biggest scam money making hoaxes in the history of the human race.  Notice how this article never once draws attention to this fact.  I wonder why not!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/3286