2008/01/14/AR2008011402725.html</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4082587910498177714/comments/default/3425715376613249521'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4082587910498177714/comments/default/3425715376613249521'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/adls-holocaust-denial.html?showComment=1200840720000#c3425715376613249521' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/adls-holocaust-denial.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4082587910498177714' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4082587910498177714' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 20, 2008 at 7:52 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2815618371239317438</id><published>2008-01-16T13:57:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-16T13:57:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>The ADL&#39;s brief states:&quot;By dividing authority betw...</title><content type='html'>The ADL&#39;s brief states:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;I&gt;&quot;By dividing authority between the federal government&lt;BR/&gt;and the States, the Framers established a federal government&lt;BR/&gt;capable of pursuing the new Nation’s interests&lt;B&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;on the global stage&lt;/B&gt; while, at the same time, preserving&lt;BR/&gt;the integrity of state and local governments best situated&lt;BR/&gt;to respond to local needs.&quot;&lt;/I&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I&#39;ve been a student of the Constitution for quite some time (35-ugg-years), but have never before seen the claim that our central government was &lt;I&gt;designed&lt;/I&gt; with the &quot;global stage&quot; in mind.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4082587910498177714/comments/default/2815618371239317438'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4082587910498177714/comments/default/2815618371239317438'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/adls-holocaust-denial.html?showComment=1200517020000#c2815618371239317438' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/adls-holocaust-denial.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4082587910498177714' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4082587910498177714' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 16, 2008 at 1:57 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-490766301039074213</id><published>2008-01-16T12:17:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-16T12:17:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>The ADL long ago stopped being about fighting anti...</title><content type='html'>The ADL long ago stopped being about fighting anti-semitism and became a left wing lobby group.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4082587910498177714/comments/default/490766301039074213'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4082587910498177714/comments/default/490766301039074213'/><link 