aust-denial.html?showComment=1200437640000#c1769890570666609807' title=''/><author><name>negatore</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/01/adls-holocaust-denial.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4082587910498177714' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4082587910498177714' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 15, 2008 at 3:54 PM"/></entry></feed>